WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.709 --> 00:00:06.410
Vladimir Putin has taken more than Ukrainian
sailors captive in the Azov Sea...

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:11.880
his high-stakes military and political maneuvering...
has ensured the "Group of TWENTY" meeting

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.809
will be dominated by TWO people.

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:19.740
The Kremlin chief and his US counterpart Donald
Trump...just like last year's G20 when Russian

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.319
meddling in US elections overshadowed the
agenda.

00:00:23.319 --> 00:00:27.819
The presidents haven't met one-on-one since
their July summit in Helsinki, where Trump's

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:34.429
behavior toward Putin was bizarrely submissive,
leaving huge questions looming in Buenos Aires.

00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:39.929
European leaders and his advisers back home
all want to show a united front and that's

00:00:39.929 --> 00:00:41.720
really our objective.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:47.050
It doesn't really matter so much what what
the practical steps are, as long as we can

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:51.760
show a united front because remember Putin's
objective is to sow discord and disunity in

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.870
the Western alliance."

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:58.379
Europe's geography dooms it to being caught
in the middle of Moscow and Washington politically.

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:01.550
When tensions flare in those capitals, Brussels
feels the burn.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:06.070
At the G20, it will be difficult for Europeans
to see their serious concerns on global trade

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.770
addressed while navigating other diplomatic
danger zones.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:14.799
There are so many things going on there that
could cause problems.

00:01:14.799 --> 00:01:17.920
I mean you know Xi Jinping will be there.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:23.500
So it's possible that if there is language
on trade, that Trump will demand that it says

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:29.170
something very negative about China or that
others will want to say something very negative

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:33.340
about protectionism and Trump will insist
that protectionism is good and America is

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.899
first.

00:01:34.899 --> 00:01:37.979
Don't forget you also have the Saudis there."

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:43.120
As Ian Bond points out, even more political
drama will be ensured by the presence of Saudi

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:48.200
Arabia's Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman,
accused of ordering the murder of journalist

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.930
Jamal Khashoggi.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:55.280
Many European leaders have expressed outrage
and scaled back ties but Trump hasn't.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:59.909
One thing is certain about this G20 -- there
are going to be some awfully awkward photo

00:01:59.909 --> 00:02:00.259
ops.

